{"1":{"w":[{"c":"الْحَاقَّةُ","d":"al-ḥāqatu","e":"The Inevitable Reality!"}],"a":{"g":"The Inevitable Reality -"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"الْحَاقَّةُ","d":"l-ḥāqatu","e":"(is) the Inevitable Reality"}],"a":{"g":"What is the Inevitable Reality?"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"أَدْرَاكَ","d":"adrāka","e":"will make you know"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"الْحَاقَّةُ","d":"l-ḥāqatu","e":"(is) the Inevitable Reality"}],"a":{"g":"And what can make you know what is the Inevitable Reality?"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"ثَمُودُ","d":"thamūdu","e":"Thamud"},{"c":"وَعَادٌ","d":"waʿādun","e":"and Aad"},{"c":"بِالْقَارِعَةِ","d":"bil-qāriʿati","e":"the Striking Calamity"}],"a":{"g":"Thamud and 'Aad denied the Striking Calamity."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"So as for"},{"c":"ثَمُودُ","d":"thamūdu","e":"Thamud"},{"c":"فَأُهْلِكُوا","d":"fa-uh'likū","e":"they were destroyed"},{"c":"بِالطَّاغِيَةِ","d":"bil-ṭāghiyati","e":"by the overpowering (blast)"}],"a":{"g":"So as for Thamud, they were destroyed by the overpowering [blast]."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"And as for"},{"c":"عَادٌ","d":"ʿādun","e":"Aad"},{"c":"فَأُهْلِكُوا","d":"fa-uh'likū","e":"they were destroyed"},{"c":"بِرِيحٍ","d":"birīḥin","e":"by a wind"},{"c":"صَرْصَرٍ","d":"ṣarṣarin","e":"screaming"},{"c":"عَاتِيَةٍ","d":"ʿātiyatin","e":"violent"}],"a":{"g":"And as for 'Aad, they were destroyed by a screaming, violent wind"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"سَخَّرَهَا","d":"sakharahā","e":"Which He imposed"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"سَبْعَ","d":"sabʿa","e":"(for) seven"},{"c":"لَيَالٍ","d":"layālin","e":"nights"},{"c":"وَثَمَانِيَةَ","d":"wathamāniyata","e":"and eight"},{"c":"أَيَّامٍ","d":"ayyāmin","e":"days"},{"c":"حُسُومًا","d":"ḥusūman","e":"(in) succession"},{"c":"فَتَرَى","d":"fatarā","e":"so you would see"},{"c":"الْقَوْمَ","d":"l-qawma","e":"the people"},{"c":"فِيهَا","d":"fīhā","e":"therein"},{"c":"صَرْعَى","d":"ṣarʿā","e":"fallen"},{"c":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","d":"ka-annahum","e":"as if they were"},{"c":"أَعْجَازُ","d":"aʿjāzu","e":"trunks"},{"c":"نَخْلٍ","d":"nakhlin","e":"(of) date-palms"},{"c":"خَاوِيَةٍ","d":"khāwiyatin","e":"hollow"}],"a":{"g":"Which Allah imposed upon them for seven nights and eight days in succession, so you would see the people therein fallen as if they were hollow trunks of palm trees."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"Then do"},{"c":"تَرَى","d":"tarā","e":"you see"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"of them"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"بَاقِيَةٍ","d":"bāqiyatin","e":"remains"}],"a":{"g":"Then do you see of them any remains?"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"وَجَاءَ","d":"wajāa","e":"And came"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنُ","d":"fir'ʿawnu","e":"Firaun"},{"c":"وَمَنْ","d":"waman","e":"and (those)"},{"c":"قَبْلَهُ","d":"qablahu","e":"before him"},{"c":"وَالْمُؤْتَفِكَاتُ","d":"wal-mu'tafikātu","e":"and the overturned cities"},{"c":"بِالْخَاطِئَةِ","d":"bil-khāṭi-ati","e":"with sin"}],"a":{"g":"And there came Pharaoh and those before him and the overturned cities with sin."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"فَعَصَوْا","d":"faʿaṣaw","e":"And they disobeyed"},{"c":"رَسُولَ","d":"rasūla","e":"(the) Messenger"},{"c":"رَبِّهِمْ","d":"rabbihim","e":"(of) their Lord"},{"c":"فَأَخَذَهُمْ","d":"fa-akhadhahum","e":"so He seized them"},{"c":"أَخْذَةً","d":"akhdhatan","e":"(with) a seizure"},{"c":"رَابِيَةً","d":"rābiyatan","e":"exceeding"}],"a":{"g":"And they disobeyed the messenger of their Lord, so He seized them with a seizure exceeding [in severity]."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"when"},{"c":"طَغَى","d":"ṭaghā","e":"overflowed"},{"c":"الْمَاءُ","d":"l-māu","e":"the water"},{"c":"حَمَلْنَاكُمْ","d":"ḥamalnākum","e":"We carried you"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْجَارِيَةِ","d":"l-jāriyati","e":"the sailing (ship)"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, when the water overflowed, We carried your ancestors in the sailing ship"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"لِنَجْعَلَهَا","d":"linajʿalahā","e":"That We might make it"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"تَذْكِرَةً","d":"tadhkiratan","e":"a reminder"},{"c":"وَتَعِيَهَا","d":"wataʿiyahā","e":"and would be conscious of it"},{"c":"أُذُنٌ","d":"udhunun","e":"an ear"},{"c":"وَاعِيَةٌ","d":"wāʿiyatun","e":"conscious"}],"a":{"g":"That We might make it for you a reminder and [that] a conscious ear would be conscious of it."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"Then when"},{"c":"نُفِخَ","d":"nufikha","e":"is blown"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الصُّورِ","d":"l-ṣūri","e":"the trumpet"},{"c":"نَفْخَةٌ","d":"nafkhatun","e":"a blast"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةٌ","d":"wāḥidatun","e":"single"}],"a":{"g":"Then when the Horn is blown with one blast"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"وَحُمِلَتِ","d":"waḥumilati","e":"And are lifted"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"وَالْجِبَالُ","d":"wal-jibālu","e":"and the mountains"},{"c":"فَدُكَّتَا","d":"fadukkatā","e":"and crushed"},{"c":"دَكَّةً","d":"dakkatan","e":"(with) a crushing"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةً","d":"wāḥidatan","e":"single"}],"a":{"g":"And the earth and the mountains are lifted and leveled with one blow -"}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"فَيَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"fayawma-idhin","e":"Then (on) that Day"},{"c":"وَقَعَتِ","d":"waqaʿati","e":"will occur"},{"c":"الْوَاقِعَةُ","d":"l-wāqiʿatu","e":"the Occurrence"}],"a":{"g":"Then on that Day, the Resurrection will occur,"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"وَانْشَقَّتِ","d":"wa-inshaqqati","e":"And will split"},{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"l-samāu","e":"the heaven"},{"c":"فَهِيَ","d":"fahiya","e":"so it"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"(is on) that Day"},{"c":"وَاهِيَةٌ","d":"wāhiyatun","e":"frail"}],"a":{"g":"And the heaven will split [open], for that Day it is infirm."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْمَلَكُ","d":"wal-malaku","e":"And the Angels"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"(will be) on"},{"c":"أَرْجَائِهَا","d":"arjāihā","e":"its edges"},{"c":"وَيَحْمِلُ","d":"wayaḥmilu","e":"and will bear"},{"c":"عَرْشَ","d":"ʿarsha","e":"(the) Throne"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"فَوْقَهُمْ","d":"fawqahum","e":"above them"},{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"that Day"},{"c":"ثَمَانِيَةٌ","d":"thamāniyatun","e":"eight"}],"a":{"g":"And the angels are at its edges. And there will bear the Throne of your Lord above them, that Day, eight [of them]."}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَئِذٍ","d":"yawma-idhin","e":"That Day"},{"c":"تُعْرَضُونَ","d":"tuʿ'raḍūna","e":"you will be exhibited"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تَخْفَى","d":"takhfā","e":"will be hidden"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"among you"},{"c":"خَافِيَةٌ","d":"khāfiyatun","e":"any secret"}],"a":{"g":"That Day, you will be exhibited [for judgement]; not hidden among you is anything concealed."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَمَّا","d":"fa-ammā","e":"Then as for"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"أُوتِيَ","d":"ūtiya","e":"is given"},{"c":"كِتَابَهُ","d":"kitābahu","e":"his record"},{"c":"بِيَمِينِهِ","d":"biyamīnihi","e":"in his right hand"},{"c":"فَيَقُولُ","d":"fayaqūlu","e":"will say"},{"c":"هَاؤُمُ","d":"hāumu","e":"Here"},{"c":"اقْرَءُوا","d":"iq'raū","e":"read"},{"c":"كِتَابِيَهْ","d":"kitābiyah","e":"my record!"}],"a":{"g":"So as for he who is given his record in his right hand, he will say, \"Here, read my record!"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"إِنِّي","d":"innī","e":"Indeed I"},{"c":"ظَنَنْتُ","d":"ẓanantu","e":"was certain"},{"c":"أَنِّي","d":"annī","e":"that I"},{"c":"مُلَاقٍ","d":"mulāqin","e":"(will) meet"},{"c":"حِسَابِيَهْ","d":"ḥisābiyah","e":"my account"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, I was certain that I would be meeting my account.\""}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"فَهُوَ","d":"fahuwa","e":"So he"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"عِيشَةٍ","d":"ʿīshatin","e":"a life"},{"c":"رَاضِيَةٍ","d":"rāḍiyatin","e":"pleasant"}],"a":{"g":"So he will be in a pleasant life -"}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"جَنَّةٍ","d":"jannatin","e":"a Garden"},{"c":"عَالِيَةٍ","d":"ʿāliyatin","e":"elevated"}],"a":{"g":"In an elevated garden,"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"قُطُوفُهَا","d":"quṭūfuhā","e":"Its clusters of fruits"},{"c":"دَانِيَةٌ","d":"dāniyatun","e":"hanging near"}],"a":{"g":"Its [fruit] to be picked hanging near."}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"كُلُوا","d":"kulū","e":"Eat"},{"c":"وَاشْرَبُوا","d":"wa-ish'rabū","e":"and drink"},{"c":"هَنِيئًا","d":"hanīan","e":"(in) satisfaction"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"أَسْلَفْتُمْ","d":"aslaftum","e":"you sent before you"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَيَّامِ","d":"l-ayāmi","e":"the days"},{"c":"الْخَالِيَةِ","d":"l-khāliyati","e":"past"}],"a":{"g":"[They will be told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you put forth in the days past.\""}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"وَأَمَّا","d":"wa-ammā","e":"But as for"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(him) who"},{"c":"أُوتِيَ","d":"ūtiya","e":"is given"},{"c":"كِتَابَهُ","d":"kitābahu","e":"his record"},{"c":"بِشِمَالِهِ","d":"bishimālihi","e":"in his left hand"},{"c":"فَيَقُولُ","d":"fayaqūlu","e":"will say"},{"c":"يَالَيْتَنِي","d":"yālaytanī","e":"O! I wish"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"أُوتَ","d":"ūta","e":"I had been given"},{"c":"كِتَابِيَهْ","d":"kitābiyah","e":"my record"}],"a":{"g":"But as for he who is given his record in his left hand, he will say, \"Oh, I wish I had not been given my record"}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَمْ","d":"walam","e":"And not"},{"c":"أَدْرِ","d":"adri","e":"I had known"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"حِسَابِيَهْ","d":"ḥisābiyah","e":"(is) my account"}],"a":{"g":"And had not known what is my account."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"يَا‎لَيْتَهَا","d":"yālaytahā","e":"O! I wish it"},{"c":"كَانَتِ","d":"kānati","e":"had been"},{"c":"الْقَاضِيَةَ","d":"l-qāḍiyata","e":"the end"}],"a":{"g":"I wish my death had been the decisive one."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"Not"},{"c":"أَغْنَى","d":"aghnā","e":"has availed"},{"c":"عَنِّي","d":"ʿannī","e":"me"},{"c":"مَالِيَهْ","d":"māliyah","e":"my wealth"}],"a":{"g":"My wealth has not availed me."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"هَلَكَ","d":"halaka","e":"Is gone"},{"c":"عَنِّي","d":"ʿannī","e":"from me"},{"c":"سُلْطَانِيَهْ","d":"sul'ṭāniyah","e":"my authority"}],"a":{"g":"Gone from me is my authority.\""}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"خُذُوهُ","d":"khudhūhu","e":"Seize him"},{"c":"فَغُلُّوهُ","d":"faghullūhu","e":"and shackle him"}],"a":{"g":"[Allah will say], \"Seize him and shackle him."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"الْجَحِيمَ","d":"l-jaḥīma","e":"(into) the Hellfire"},{"c":"صَلُّوهُ","d":"ṣallūhu","e":"burn him"}],"a":{"g":"Then into Hellfire drive him."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"into"},{"c":"سِلْسِلَةٍ","d":"sil'silatin","e":"a chain"},{"c":"ذَرْعُهَا","d":"dharʿuhā","e":"its length"},{"c":"سَبْعُونَ","d":"sabʿūna","e":"(is) seventy"},{"c":"ذِرَاعًا","d":"dhirāʿan","e":"cubits"},{"c":"فَاسْلُكُوهُ","d":"fa-us'lukūhu","e":"insert him"}],"a":{"g":"Then into a chain whose length is seventy cubits insert him.\""}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed, he"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"(did)"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"يُؤْمِنُ","d":"yu'minu","e":"believe"},{"c":"بِاللَّهِ","d":"bil-lahi","e":"in Allah"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمِ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmi","e":"the Most Great"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, he did not used to believe in Allah, the Most Great,"}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And (did) not"},{"c":"يَحُضُّ","d":"yaḥuḍḍu","e":"feel the urge"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"طَعَامِ","d":"ṭaʿāmi","e":"(the) feeding"},{"c":"الْمِسْكِينِ","d":"l-mis'kīni","e":"(of) the poor"}],"a":{"g":"Nor did he encourage the feeding of the poor."}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَيْسَ","d":"falaysa","e":"So not"},{"c":"لَهُ","d":"lahu","e":"for him"},{"c":"الْيَوْمَ","d":"l-yawma","e":"today"},{"c":"هَاهُنَا","d":"hāhunā","e":"here"},{"c":"حَمِيمٌ","d":"ḥamīmun","e":"any devoted friend"}],"a":{"g":"So there is not for him here this Day any devoted friend"}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"طَعَامٌ","d":"ṭaʿāmun","e":"any food"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"غِسْلِينٍ","d":"ghis'līnin","e":"(the) discharge of wounds"}],"a":{"g":"Nor any food except from the discharge of wounds;"}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"Not"},{"c":"يَأْكُلُهُ","d":"yakuluhu","e":"will eat it"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"الْخَاطِءُونَ","d":"l-khāṭiūna","e":"the sinners"}],"a":{"g":"None will eat it except the sinners."}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"فَلَا","d":"falā","e":"But nay!"},{"c":"أُقْسِمُ","d":"uq'simu","e":"I swear"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"by what"},{"c":"تُبْصِرُونَ","d":"tub'ṣirūna","e":"you see"}],"a":{"g":"So I swear by what you see"}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And what"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"not"},{"c":"تُبْصِرُونَ","d":"tub'ṣirūna","e":"you see"}],"a":{"g":"And what you do not see"}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّهُ","d":"innahu","e":"Indeed it (is)"},{"c":"لَقَوْلُ","d":"laqawlu","e":"surely (the) Word"},{"c":"رَسُولٍ","d":"rasūlin","e":"(of) a Messenger"},{"c":"كَرِيمٍ","d":"karīmin","e":"noble"}],"a":{"g":"[That] indeed, the Qur'an is the word of a noble Messenger."}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"it"},{"c":"بِقَوْلِ","d":"biqawli","e":"(is the) word"},{"c":"شَاعِرٍ","d":"shāʿirin","e":"(of) a poet;"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"little"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"تُؤْمِنُونَ","d":"tu'minūna","e":"you believe!"}],"a":{"g":"And it is not the word of a poet; little do you believe."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"بِقَوْلِ","d":"biqawli","e":"(it is the) word"},{"c":"كَاهِنٍ","d":"kāhinin","e":"(of) a soothsayer;"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"little"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"(is) what"},{"c":"تَذَكَّرُونَ","d":"tadhakkarūna","e":"you remember"}],"a":{"g":"Nor the word of a soothsayer; little do you remember."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"تَنْزِيلٌ","d":"tanzīlun","e":"(It is) a revelation"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"رَبِّ","d":"rabbi","e":"(the) Lord"},{"c":"الْعَالَمِينَ","d":"l-ʿālamīna","e":"(of) the worlds"}],"a":{"g":"[It is] a revelation from the Lord of the worlds."}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَوْ","d":"walaw","e":"And if"},{"c":"تَقَوَّلَ","d":"taqawwala","e":"he (had) fabricated"},{"c":"عَلَيْنَا","d":"ʿalaynā","e":"against Us"},{"c":"بَعْضَ","d":"baʿḍa","e":"some"},{"c":"الْأَقَاوِيلِ","d":"l-aqāwīli","e":"sayings"}],"a":{"g":"And if Muhammad had made up about Us some [false] sayings,"}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"لَأَخَذْنَا","d":"la-akhadhnā","e":"Certainly We (would) have seized"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"him"},{"c":"بِالْيَمِينِ","d":"bil-yamīni","e":"by the right hand;"}],"a":{"g":"We would have seized him by the right hand;"}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"لَقَطَعْنَا","d":"laqaṭaʿnā","e":"certainly We (would) have cut off"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from him"},{"c":"الْوَتِينَ","d":"l-watīna","e":"the aorta"}],"a":{"g":"Then We would have cut from him the aorta."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"And not"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"from you"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"أَحَدٍ","d":"aḥadin","e":"one"},{"c":"عَنْهُ","d":"ʿanhu","e":"[from him]"},{"c":"حَاجِزِينَ","d":"ḥājizīna","e":"(could) prevent"}],"a":{"g":"And there is no one of you who could prevent [Us] from him."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهُ","d":"wa-innahu","e":"And indeed it"},{"c":"لَتَذْكِرَةٌ","d":"latadhkiratun","e":"(is) surely a reminder"},{"c":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"lil'muttaqīna","e":"for the Allah-fearing"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, the Qur'an is a reminder for the righteous."}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّا","d":"wa-innā","e":"And indeed We"},{"c":"لَنَعْلَمُ","d":"lanaʿlamu","e":"surely know"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"among you"},{"c":"مُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"mukadhibīna","e":"(are) deniers"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, We know that among you are deniers."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهُ","d":"wa-innahu","e":"And indeed it"},{"c":"لَحَسْرَةٌ","d":"laḥasratun","e":"(is) surely a regret"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"upon"},{"c":"الْكَافِرِينَ","d":"l-kāfirīna","e":"the disbelievers"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, it will be [a cause of] regret upon the disbelievers."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنَّهُ","d":"wa-innahu","e":"And indeed it (is)"},{"c":"لَحَقُّ","d":"laḥaqqu","e":"surely (the) truth"},{"c":"الْيَقِينِ","d":"l-yaqīni","e":"(of) certainty"}],"a":{"g":"And indeed, it is the truth of certainty."}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"فَسَبِّحْ","d":"fasabbiḥ","e":"So glorify"},{"c":"بِاسْمِ","d":"bi-is'mi","e":"(the) name"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمِ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmi","e":"the Most Great"}],"a":{"g":"So exalt the name of your Lord, the Most Great."}}}